      <title>微软打破 Patch Tuesday 记录 一次性推送 974 个 CVE</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260909/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF%E6%89%93%E7%A0%B4-Patch-Tuesday-%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95-%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E6%80%A7%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81-974-%E4%B8%AA-CVE/</link>
